source-sphere | N_sph,0=N_0 is the displayed compact real form; N_sph=N is its image under the same left perturbation and Phi. The identity substitutions cover the homology class, reference comparison, Borel pair, quotient, orientation, linking and every final eight-fold bounding-chain use. The opening cusp N and its universal/period covers are outside this scope and keep their names. The restricted tangent bundle uses braces around the full new sphere name.
